Version 1.9.3
        * HierarchicalCUDAIndex: the cooperative k-NN search width is a runtime
          parameter, SearchParams::cuda_search_width, refused rather than clamped
        * BINARY INCOMPATIBLE with 1.9.2 for one symbol.
          flann::cuda::launch_hierarchical_search_cooperative takes the width as a
          new penultimate argument, so its mangled name changes and a caller compiled
          against 1.9.2's header does not resolve against 1.9.3's library. The real
          filename moves to libflann_cuda.so.1.9.3; the soname stays libflann_cuda.so.1.9,
          since FLANN_SOVERSION is major.minor. A consumer that bundles the library by its
          real filename must move that name with this bump.

